        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111:\n\nDelete the edge (1,2)(1,2)(1,2) and select node 111.\n\nX=X⊕siz(1)=0⊕1=1X = X \\oplus \\text{siz}(1) = 0 \\oplus 1 = 1X=X⊕siz(1)=0⊕1=1.\n\n\n\nTest case 222:\n\nDelete the edge (3,1)(3,1)(3,1) and select node 333.\n\nX=X⊕siz(3)=0⊕1=1X = X \\oplus \\text{siz}(3) = 0 \\oplus 1 = 1X=X⊕siz(3)=0⊕1=1.\n\n\nCut the edge (1,2)(1,2)(1,2) and select node 222.\n\nX=X⊕siz(2)=1⊕1=0X = X \\oplus \\text{siz}(2) = 1 \\oplus 1 = 0X=X⊕siz(2)=1⊕1=0."
